skill-atlas rows (5,000) are decisions about public agent skills (SKILL.md files) from repositories licensed MIT or
Apache-2.0. Per-skill attribution (repository, path, licence) is in ATTRIBUTION.json.

The remaining training rows are synthetic: rule-generated rows and rows written by Claude Opus 5.5 for this project.

The prompt format (system prompt and JSON user turn) is that of TEV (togethercomputer/Tev1-4B-experimental).
